    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT OTHER GAMES</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851470/extras/2416cee1359fd1ae461e16bfa60d74be.avif?t=1690196054\" /></div><br>Yaoi, BxB, Visual Novel, Dating Sim, Romance, Amare, Comedy<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851470/extras/c6344a76d7fe8edbe7005a1a4b4a1308.avif?t=1690196054\" /></div><br>After slaying a dragon, Ikkarus returned to his village and received an unexpected establishment as a reward: a tavern. After visiting it, he discovered the place is an utter disaster and has also accumulated a shocking debt of 50.000 gold. This could leave anyone furious but Ikkarus, a true hero, saw that as a challenge. Now, he will try to fix the place and prove to the man who gave the present that he is a natural hero. In the meantime, why not meet 3 men who can help him in his new mission and fall in love with them?  <br><br>Follow Ikkarus in this Yaoi slice-of-life about making drinks, meeting unique bartenders, and hunting cute monsters.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851470/extras/10441f8d1d87aa9967d1c371c79cdc34.avif?t=1690196054\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5+ hours of gameplay<br></li><li>3 Love Partners (an orc, a demon, and a human);<br></li><li>6 Endings (a good and a bad one for each partner);<br></li><li>13 CGs;<br></li><li>Difficulty Selection (Easy mode for visual novel players and other focused on gameplay aspects);<br></li><li>Side Quests;</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851470/extras/3229febad79bf06cac87d758a66ecea7.avif?t=1690196054\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851470/extras/f12a8783c6dcc1537f789ce21eb0e186.avif?t=1690196054\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851470/extras/35f33f9e6a208c2431f7711b94f66971.avif?t=1690196054\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851470/extras/5c6b571baa8d78cd77c3b35b72c71c14.avif?t=1690196054\" /></div>",
